    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_batch.py` that moderates a batch of user messages using a concrete external provider, I will use the Perspective API by Jigsaw, which is a service that helps identify toxic content in text. I will import the necessary library and use the API to analyze each message in the batch. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862381355,
          "start": 1789862379029
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc1c7e15001or8R7IqWvx40GG",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc1c799c001x2FH2dUaFWGoVT",
      "session_id": "ses_f43e3867bffe9GYI89iM7W95yi",
