    {
      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `moderate_text.py` that scores user text for unsafe or policy-violating content using a concrete external provider, I will use the Amazon Comprehend service. This service is identifiable by the `boto3` library import, which is specific to AWS services, and the use of the `Comprehend` client. </thinking>\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789862375734,
          "start": 1789862374151
        },
        "type": "text"
      },
      "id": "prt_0bc1c6b070014Y6zj35CaZd4Mg",
      "message_id": "msg_0bc1c65ab001WG3wLHaUcqVWhn",
